      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Irrigon%2C_Oregon"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The area now known as Irrigon was originally inhabited by Native American tribes, including the Umatilla, who lived off the Columbia River.",
